        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īyī yene mihayo ya kwihela kwa shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Adamu. Ū Mulungu aho wanseema ū munhū, akaameeja mu suso yakwe wei ng'wenīkīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbaseema ngosha na nkīma; aho wamala kūbaseema ūbafuuha, ūbinha lina lya munhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Adamu aho washisha būlamu bo myaka igana na makūmi adatū (130), ūbyala ng'wana ngosha wa kūng'wikola we, mu suso yakwe; ī lina lyakwe ūng'wilīka Seti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūfuma a ha kūbyalwa kwa ng'wa Seti, ū Adamu akikala ho myaka magana anaane (800); ūbyala na bitūnja bangī, hamò na bashīke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī myaka ya būlamu bo ng'wa Adamu ī yose yalī magana kenda na makūmi adatū (930), hūna ūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
